        <div class="section" id="a1">
            <h2><span class="section-icon">📐</span>A.1 Formulaire</h2>
<h3>Circuits</h3>
<div class="eq">U = Z·I &nbsp; S = U·I* = P + jQ &nbsp; Z<sub>L</sub> = jLω &nbsp; Z<sub>C</sub> = 1/(jCω) &nbsp; ω = 2πf<br>
Triphasé : U = √3·V &nbsp; P = √3·U·I·cos φ &nbsp; Q<sub>C</sub> = P(tan φ₁ − tan φ₂) &nbsp; C = Q<sub>C</sub>/(ωU²)</div>
<h3>Réseaux</h3>
<div class="eq">Z<sub>b</sub> = U<sub>b</sub>²/S<sub>b</sub> &nbsp; I<sub>b</sub> = S<sub>b</sub>/(√3U<sub>b</sub>) &nbsp; ΔU/U ≈ (RP + XQ)/U² &nbsp; ΔP = R(P² + Q²)/U²<br>
Transformateur : Z<sub>cc</sub> = u<sub>cc</sub>U²/S<sub>n</sub> &nbsp; R<sub>cc</sub> = P<sub>cc</sub>U²/S<sub>n</sub>² &nbsp; X<sub>cc</sub> = √(Z<sub>cc</sub>² − R<sub>cc</sub>²)<br>
Load flow : S<sub>i</sub>* = V<sub>i</sub>*Σ<sub>k</sub>Y<sub>ik</sub>V<sub>k</sub> &nbsp; Gauss-Seidel : V<sub>i</sub> = [(P<sub>i</sub> − jQ<sub>i</sub>)/V<sub>i</sub>* − Σ<sub>k≠i</sub>Y<sub>ik</sub>V<sub>k</sub>]/Y<sub>ii</sub></div>
<h3>Court-circuit (CEI 60909-0)</h3>
<div class="eq">I"k3 = cU<sub>n</sub>/(√3|Z₁|) &nbsp; I"k2 = cU<sub>n</sub>/|Z₁ + Z₂| &nbsp; I"k1 = √3cU<sub>n</sub>/|Z₁ + Z₂ + Z₀|<br>
I"<sub>kE2E</sub> = √3cU<sub>n</sub>|Z₂|/|Z₁Z₂ + Z₁Z₀ + Z₂Z₀| &nbsp; i<sub>p</sub> = κ√2 I"k &nbsp; κ = 1,02 + 0,98e<sup>−3R/X</sup> &nbsp; S"k = √3U<sub>n</sub>I"k</div>
<h3>Machines tournantes</h3>
<div class="eq">Synchrone : E = V + jX<sub>d</sub>I &nbsp; P = (EV/X<sub>d</sub>)sin δ &nbsp; Q = (EV cos δ − V²)/X<sub>d</sub> &nbsp; capacité : p² + q² ≤ v² ; p² + (q + v²/X<sub>d</sub>)² ≤ (vE<sub>fd max</sub>/X<sub>d</sub>)²<br>
Asynchrone : s = (n<sub>s</sub> − n)/n<sub>s</sub> &nbsp; n<sub>s</sub> = 60f/p &nbsp; P<sub>méc</sub> = 3I<sub>r</sub>²R<sub>r</sub>(1 − s)/s &nbsp; C ∝ V² &nbsp; Z<sub>M</sub> = U<sub>n</sub>²/((I<sub>LR</sub>/I<sub>rM</sub>)·S<sub>rM</sub>) (CEI 60909, R/X = 0,10 ; 0,15 ; 0,42)</div>
<h3>Protection et sélectivité</h3>
<div class="eq">Temps inverse (CEI 60255-151) : t = TMS·k/((I/I<sub>s</sub>)<sup>α</sup> − 1) &nbsp; SI : k = 0,14, α = 0,02 &nbsp; VI : 13,5 ; 1 &nbsp; EI : 80 ; 2<br>
Marge de sélectivité chronométrique ≈ 0,3 s &nbsp; Tenue des câbles : I²t ≤ k²S² (k = 143 Cu/PR) &nbsp; Fusibles gG en série : calibre amont ≥ 1,6 × aval<br>
Distance : Z = V/I &nbsp; zones 80 % (instantané), 120 % (0,3 s), 200 % (1 s) &nbsp; k<sub>0</sub> = (Z₀ − Z₁)/(3Z₁) &nbsp; Z<sub>0,éq</sub> = (Z<sub>A</sub>Z<sub>B</sub> − Z<sub>0m</sub>²)/(Z<sub>A</sub> + Z<sub>B</sub> − 2Z<sub>0m</sub>)<br>
TC : ALF′ = ALF·(R<sub>ct</sub>I<sub>sn</sub>² + S<sub>n</sub>)/(R<sub>ct</sub>I<sub>sn</sub>² + S<sub>b</sub>)</div>
<h3>Régime de neutre et coordination d'isolement</h3>
<div class="eq">Neutre isolé : I<sub>c</sub> = 3ωC<sub>0</sub>U<sub>n</sub>/√3 &nbsp; phases saines : √3 × tension simple<br>
Résistance : R<sub>n</sub> = U<sub>n</sub>/(√3·I<sub>lim</sub>) &nbsp; Petersen : L = 1/(3ω²C<sub>0</sub>(1 + v)) &nbsp; I<sub>résiduel</sub> ≈ I<sub>c</sub>√(v² + r²)<br>
Parafoudre : U<sub>eq</sub> = U<sub>pl</sub> + 2SL/v (v = 300 m/µs) &nbsp; marge BIL/U<sub>eq</sub> ≥ 1,2 &nbsp; TOV : U<sub>r</sub> ≥ k·U<sub>m</sub>/(√3·T), k ≈ 1,4 (terre) ou √3 (isolé, compensé)</div>
<h3>Solaire</h3>
<div class="eq">δ = 23,45 sin(360(284 + n)/365) &nbsp; ω<sub>s</sub> = arccos(−tan φ tan δ) &nbsp; K<sub>t</sub> = H/H₀<br>
H<sub>β</sub> = H[(1 − H<sub>d</sub>/H)R<sub>b</sub> + (H<sub>d</sub>/H)(1 + cos β)/2 + ρ(1 − cos β)/2]<br>
P = P<sub>c</sub>(G/1000)(1 + γ(T<sub>c</sub> − 25)) &nbsp; T<sub>c</sub> = T<sub>a</sub> + (NOCT − 20)G/800 &nbsp; E = P<sub>c</sub>·H<sub>β</sub>·PR</div>
<h3>PV autonome (méthode NRJXpert)</h3>
<div class="eq">Q<sub>j</sub> = E<sub>j</sub>/(U·η<sub>conv</sub>·0,98·0,9) &nbsp; C = Q<sub>j</sub>·autonomie(h)/24 &nbsp; N<sub>p,batt</sub> = ⌈C/(C<sub>batt</sub>·DoD)⌉<br>
PWM : N<sub>p</sub> = ⌈Q<sub>j</sub>/(0,9·H·I<sub>mp</sub>)⌉ &nbsp; MPPT : P<sub>c</sub> = Q<sub>j</sub>U/(H·0,9·f<sub>T</sub>·0,96) &nbsp; régulateur et onduleur : × 1,25</div>
<h3>Câblage</h3>
<div class="eq">I<sub>b</sub> = 1,25·I &nbsp; I<sub>n</sub> ≥ I<sub>b</sub> &nbsp; I<sub>z0</sub>(S)·k<sub>θ</sub>·k<sub>g</sub> ≥ I<sub>n</sub> &nbsp; k<sub>θ</sub> = √((90 − θ<sub>a</sub>)/60)<br>
ΔU = b(ρL/S cos φ + λL sin φ)I &nbsp; (b = 2 continu et monophasé, 1 triphasé sur V) &nbsp; ρ<sub>Cu</sub> = 0,0225 &nbsp; ρ<sub>Al</sub> = 0,036 Ω·mm²/m &nbsp; λ = 0,08 mΩ/m</div>
<h3>Éolien</h3>
<div class="eq">P = ½ρAv³ &nbsp; f(v) = (k/c)(v/c)<sup>k−1</sup>e<sup>−(v/c)<sup>k</sup></sup> &nbsp; v̄ = cΓ(1 + 1/k) &nbsp; ½ρc³Γ(1 + 3/k)<br>
v(H) = v(H<sub>mes</sub>)ln(H/z₀)/ln(H<sub>mes</sub>/z₀) &nbsp; E = 8 760∫P(v)f(v)dv(1 − pertes) &nbsp; FC = E/(8 760P<sub>n</sub>)</div>
<h3>Pompage solaire</h3>
<div class="eq">HMT = HG + P<sub>C</sub> &nbsp; E<sub>el</sub> = 2,725·V·HMT/(η<sub>p</sub>η<sub>m</sub>η<sub>conv</sub>) &nbsp; P<sub>c</sub> = E<sub>el</sub>/(Ens·η<sub>c</sub>)<br>
Q<sub>max</sub> = πV/(2ΔT) &nbsp; P<sub>H</sub> = Q<sub>max</sub>·HMT/367 &nbsp; P<sub>c</sub> = P<sub>H</sub>/(η<sub>p</sub>η<sub>m</sub>η<sub>conv</sub>η<sub>c</sub>)·1 000/G &nbsp; (V en m³/j, Q en m³/h, P<sub>H</sub> en kW)</div>
<h3>Économie</h3>
<div class="eq">CRF = a(1 + a)<sup>N</sup>/((1 + a)<sup>N</sup> − 1) &nbsp; VAN = ΣF<sub>n</sub>/(1 + a)<sup>n</sup> &nbsp; LCOE = C<sub>act</sub>/ΣE<sub>n</sub>/(1 + a)<sup>n</sup><br>
taux réel = (1 + a)/(1 + i) − 1 &nbsp; subvention minimale = max(0, −VAN/I₀)</div>
            <a href="#top" class="back-to-top">↑ Retour en haut</a>
        </div>
